c This is a simple DQBF formula
c Universally quantified variables (a): 1, 2, 3, 4, 5
c Dependent existential variables (d): 6, 7, 8
c
c Dependencies:
c Variable 6 depends only on 1 and 2
c Variable 7 depends only on 3 and 4
c Variable 8 depends only on 5
c
p cnf 8 8
a 1 2 3 4 5 0
d 6 1 2 0
d 7 3 4 0
d 8 5 0
c
c Clauses encoding d6 = a1 OR a2
-6 1 2 0
-1 6 0
-2 6 0
c
c Clauses encoding d7 = a3 AND a4
-7 3 0
-7 4 0
-3 -4 7 0
c
c Clauses encoding d8 = NOT a5
-8 -5 0
5 8 0